      ],
      "font": "SFRM1200",
      "size": 11.9552001953125,
      "dir": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "text": "중력 가속도"
    },
    {
      "id": "p9:b14:l2:s7-31",
      "page": 9,
      "at": [
        14,
        2,
        7,
        31
      ],
      "source": ". The first ring is fixed, while the second ring, whose resistance is",
